#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:5
#: a3204f88d4f6443094bbff259290d943
msgid "Mission Planner Overview"
msgstr "Mission Planner 概述"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:7
#: bf67f5020e9a40a59f931553df0dc4ea
msgid ""
"Mission Planner is a full-featured ground station application for the "
"ArduPilot open source autopilot project. This page contains information on "
"the background of Mission Planner and the organization of this site."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 是 ArduPilot 开源飞控项目的全功能地面站应用。本页介绍 Mission Planner 的背景以及本站的结构。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:12
#: 47517b36f32d44628b52b3fe9134b7c4
msgid "What is Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner 是什么"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:17
#: 759a5552bd8a4dc39416c50e4cd2c7b8
msgid ""
"Mission Planner is a ground control station for Plane, Copter and Rover. It "
"is compatible with Windows only. Mission Planner can be used as a "
"configuration utility or as a dynamic control supplement for your autonomous"
" vehicle. Here are just a few things you can do with Mission Planner:"
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 是适用于 Plane、Copter 和 Rover 的地面站，仅兼容 Windows。Mission Planner "
"可用作配置工具，也可作为自主飞行器的动态控制补充工具。以下是您可以使用 Mission Planner 完成的部分功能："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:23
#: 41f21fa5f7ea42b0934368649542475f
msgid ""
"Load the :ref:`firmware <common-glossary>` (the software) into the autopilot"
" board (i.e. Pixhawk series) that controls your vehicle."
msgstr "将 :ref:`固件 <common-glossary>`（软件）加载到控制飞行器的飞控板（如 Pixhawk 系列）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:25
#: 40aff0cb97e24d9d8b3d101103edceb1
msgid "Setup, configure, and tune your vehicle for optimum performance."
msgstr "设置、配置并调参您的飞行器以获得最佳性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:26
#: 6d9b39d93d044b1a82466c646bbfb7b8
msgid ""
"Plan, save and load autonomous missions into you autopilot with simple "
"point-and-click way-point entry on Google or other maps."
msgstr "通过在 Google 地图或其他地图上简单点击航点，规划、保存和加载自主任务到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:28
#: 3016ea88d3e14d3ca9050aefc22d6046
msgid "Download and analyze mission logs created by your autopilot."
msgstr "下载并分析飞控生成的任务日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:29
#: 7799f2866e6f4989bf8a61b26810ba18
msgid ""
"Interface with a PC flight simulator to create a full hardware-in-the-loop "
"UAV simulator."
msgstr "与 PC 飞行仿真器对接，创建完整的硬件在环 UAV 仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:31
#: 6d0995f73efd4fba9d7e6653c6e942d2
msgid "With appropriate telemetry hardware you can:"
msgstr "配备适当的数传硬件后，您可以："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:33
#: 000a8398360343a3b0b46b0d01575b39
msgid "Monitor your vehicle's status while in operation."
msgstr "在飞行中监控飞行器状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:34
#: 0836d2f96a0b48e08ced546e5736c59b
msgid ""
"Record telemetry logs which contain much more information about the on-board"
" autopilot logs."
msgstr "记录包含比机载飞控日志更多信息的数传日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:36
#: 5f1c74bf80b3443abc7550003a77540e
msgid "View and analyze the telemetry logs."
msgstr "查看和分析数传日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:37
#: 7758ab4f3b624c36b142a7d2198c0c84
msgid "Operate your vehicle in FPV (first person view)"
msgstr "以 FPV（第一人称视角）操控飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:39
#: 83b258e9c4cd4e83bc3b5dfe53d96d09
msgid "All of these and many more features are covered here."
msgstr "以上这些功能及更多内容均在此处介绍。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:42
#: cccffcf8b37f49ab8f503b9f21a51414
msgid "History"
msgstr "历史"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:44
#: 6688d31da9c046648b09004477f08bdc
msgid ""
"Mission Planner is a free, open-source, community-supported application "
"developed by Michael Oborne for the open-source APM autopilot project. If "
"you would like to donate to the ongoing development of Mission Planner, "
"please refer to the following link."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 是一款由 Michael Oborne 为开源 APM 飞控项目开发的免费开源社区支持应用。如需为 Mission "
"Planner 的持续开发捐款，请参阅以下链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:49
#: 2054fc256fcc46bda9a5f83b0b26fe3e
msgid ":ref:`Donate <common-donation>`"
msgstr ":ref:`捐款 <common-donation>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:54
#: f23fb650b8514960bf01fd45a17c9cc7
msgid "Support"
msgstr "支持"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:56
#: bf5d242b3c4e446fb647edffa7baf3cd
msgid "**The Help Screen:**"
msgstr "**帮助画面：**"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:58
#: 6c6210ae653f4efc97da22a6386a6f80
msgid ""
"Clicking the Help icon at the top of the Mission Planner interface will open"
" a screen with general information about help with Mission Planner. The "
"\"Check for Updates\" button will check for available updates to Mission "
"Planner manually. Mission Planner automatically checks for updates upon "
"start up and notifies you if an update is available. Please always run the "
"most current version of Mission Planner, although it is not necessary to "
"check for updates more often than upon start up."
msgstr ""
"点击 Mission Planner 界面顶部的帮助图标，将打开包含 Mission Planner 帮助信息的页面。「Check for "
"Updates」按钮可手动检查 Mission Planner 的可用更新。Mission Planner "
"在启动时会自动检查更新，如有可用更新则通知您。请始终运行最新版本的 Mission Planner，但无需在启动时之外频繁检查更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:66
#: 76a8beb1da4945ef9ce15813176fa674
msgid ""
"The \"Check for BETA Updates\" button will install the current development "
"version of Mission Planner. This contains all the latest features and "
"updates, but also might have bugs, since it does not have extensive "
"community testing."
msgstr ""
"「Check for BETA Updates」按钮将安装当前开发版本的 Mission "
"Planner，包含所有最新功能和更新，但由于尚未经过广泛社区测试，可能存在错误。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:68
#: ebee4db93469418fbbc4930b832dc309
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the HELP screen is the check box \"Show Console Window "
"(restart)\" , which enables the console window during Mission Planner "
"operation.  That window shows Mission Planner activity and is primarily for "
"diagnostic purposes.  It sometimes shows some interesting information. A "
"restart of Mission Planner is required for the option to take effect."
msgstr ""
"HELP 页面底部有一个「Show Console Window (restart)」复选框，启用后将在 Mission Planner "
"运行时显示控制台窗口，该窗口显示 Mission Planner 的活动，主要用于诊断，有时也会显示一些有趣的信息。需要重启 Mission "
"Planner 后选项才能生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:73
#: d16544dab5aa4635964e9b7fb267ab0f
msgid "**Getting Help:**"
msgstr "**获取帮助：**"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:75
#: f14fbce7b38a406eb9dba605c468f1fe
msgid ""
"The support for Mission Planner comes from the community of users like you."
"  All of the documentation is created by users who volunteer their time. If "
"you have questions, first look through the table of contents (upper left of "
"every page) for a topic that may address your question. Next, try a search "
"of the website.  If you still need help, then the community forums are the "
"place to go. There you will find may friendly users, developers and often, "
"even Michael will chime in."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner "
"的支持来自像您一样的用户社区，所有文档均由志愿者创建。如有疑问，请先查阅每页左上角的目录，寻找可能解答您问题的主题，然后尝试搜索网站。如仍需帮助，可前往社区论坛，那里有许多热心用户、开发者，Michael"
" 本人也常常参与讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:83
#: 31351052d2c8441ba8689fbe813deaa7
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot forum `here <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__ has existed "
"for years and has a very large community and numerous general and vehicle "
"specific topics."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 论坛 `此处 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/>`__ "
"已存在多年，拥有庞大社区和众多通用及特定飞行器主题。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:87
#: a4abcb300f9741baa6f3543058664a28
msgid "**Reporting Issues:**"
msgstr "**报告问题：**"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:89
#: e95d02d9b1e742bba7010ba547942826
msgid ""
"You can often resolve a question on a forum. Sometimes you will discover a "
"bug and use the forums to request it be logged as an official issue. One of "
"the developers will normally be glad to do so."
msgstr "许多问题可以在论坛上解决。有时您会发现 Bug，并通过论坛申请将其记录为正式 Issue，开发者通常乐于处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:93
#: 02159e5a3c2e4f12acad3e14a13a3097
msgid ""
"If you see a need to change or enhance the documentation, please let us know"
" - again using the forums.  We welcome your suggestions and there are "
"qualified editors who can implement your suggestions."
msgstr "如果您发现文档需要修改或完善，请通过论坛告知我们，我们欢迎您的建议，并有专业编辑可以实施您的建议。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:98
#: a2e2dc53a0ab43e191fca9bd67fc4117
msgid "Navigating the Documentation"
msgstr "浏览文档"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:100
#: a00103832e62497b8634b483c78c8da4
msgid ""
"Use the table of contents at the top of each page to navigate the Mission "
"Planner Manual - and the contents of the vehicle specific areas."
msgstr "使用每页顶部的目录浏览 Mission Planner 手册及各飞行器专属区域的内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-overview.rst:103
#: 30f9ef22f9a640cc85468906e77db229
msgid ""
"This section of our website contains information on how to use Mission "
"Planner as a \"general\" application. However, some of the pages will also "
"have some vehicle specific information. Those pages will also be contained "
"in the specific vehicle's section of the website. Information that is "
"primarily specific to a particular vehicle will only be located in that "
"vehicles section so, if you cannot find information here, try the section of"
" the website for the vehicle you are using."
msgstr ""
"本网站的此部分介绍如何将 Mission Planner "
"作为「通用」应用使用，但部分页面也包含特定飞行器的信息，这些页面同时收录在网站的特定飞行器部分。主要针对特定飞行器的信息仅位于该飞行器的专属部分，如在此处找不到所需信息，请查阅您所使用飞行器的网站部分。"
